    dayTitle: 'Day 1 '
    roleName: Host
    dayGoalMessage: 'Goal: teach the player how to greet and assign customers to
      a table.'
    introMessage: Today you will learn how to play as the Host
    practiceStartMessage: Now do it yourself. Assign 4 customer groups to tables
      within 2 minutes.
    completionMessage: Congrats! you've perfected host tutorial!
