  - day: 1
    dayTitle: Day 2 - Waiter
    roleName: Waiter
    dayGoalMessage: 'Goal: teach the player how to take order, get bill, give bill,
      take money, and bring money to the cashier booth.'
    introMessage: Today you are the Waiter. I will teach you the full waiter flow
      step by step. Then you will handle the flow yourself.
    practiceStartMessage: Now do it yourself. Handle 2 customer groups within 2 minutes.
    completionMessage: Good job. You finished the Waiter tutorial day.
